  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ProBogota - ICT start-ups and SMEs in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to overcome Colombia&apos;s economic vulnerabilities through strengthening SMEs competitiveness and productivity based on a pertinent and high impact support from a robust Bogota Region ICT sector. Incubator and Accelerator for the ICT industry in Colombia. Tailored ICT-training for young women in cooperation with the World Bank and other players. Targeted effort on Smart Cities agenda with the purpose of reducing waste and traffic pollution in metropolitan Bogota.</narrative>
  </description>
